消费方在调用前写入短附件。提供方 Filter 读出后放进自己的线程上下文，再交给实现类：

```java
// 消费方，调用前
RpcContext.getClientAttachment().setAttachment("tenant-id", tenantId);
inventory.deduct(sku, 1);
```

```java
@Activate(group = PROVIDER)
public class TenantFilter implements Filter {
    @Override
    public Result invoke(Invoker<?> invoker, Invocation invocation) throws RpcException {
        String tenant = RpcContext.getServerAttachment().getAttachment("tenant-id");
        TenantHolder.set(tenant);
        try {
            return invoker.invoke(invocation);
        } finally {
            TenantHolder.clear();
        }
    }
}
```

